---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Icon from "../layouts/components/Icon.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths";
---

<PageLayout
  name="About"
  nameZh="关于我们"
  description="Learn about Particle Intelligence and its vision for particle research and microfluidic design."
  descriptionZh="了解 Particle Intelligence 的愿景，以及颗粒研究和微流控设计方向。"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="about-intro">
        <span class="eyebrow" data-zh="我们的故事">
          OUR STORY
        </span>
        <h1 data-zh="我们创立 Particle Intelligence，希望让颗粒运动更容易被理解和探索。">
          We started Particle Intelligence to make particle motion easier to
          understand and explore.
        </h1>
        <p
          class="page-lead"
          data-zh="颗粒在微环境中的运动受到流体、材料和几何条件共同影响。理解这些系统，需要物理、实验科学与计算工具协同工作。"
        >
          Particle motion is shaped by the interaction of fluids, materials, and
          geometry. Understanding these systems calls for physics, experimental
          science, and computational tools to work together.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="story-layout">
        <article class="story-copy">
          <span class="story-kicker" data-zh="为什么创业">
            WHY WE STARTED
          </span>
          <p data-zh="我们的创始团队来自图形软件与 GPU 编程、微流控与颗粒输运、人工智能、生物力学和金融领域。我们创立这家公司，是想把这些不同的专长汇集起来，做成服务科研与工程团队的软件工具。">
            Our founders work across graphics software and GPU programming,
            microfluidics and particle transport, artificial intelligence,
            biomechanics, and finance. We started this company to bring those
            disciplines together in software for research and engineering teams.
          </p>
          <p data-zh="我们正在开发 Phora——颗粒运动模型，以及与研究问题和实验设计相连接的工具。我们的目标是帮助团队系统地探索颗粒行为、比较不同条件，并从实验中持续学习。这些能力仍在开发与验证中。">
            We are developing Phora, our particle motion model, alongside tools
            that connect research questions with experiment design. Our aim is
            to help teams explore particle behavior, compare conditions, and
            learn from experiments. This work is still in development and
            validation.
          </p>
        </article>

        <aside class="story-vision">
          <span class="story-kicker" data-zh="我们的长期方向">
            OUR LONG-TERM DIRECTION
          </span>
          <h2 data-zh="预测。设计。学习。">Predict. Design. Learn.</h2>
          <ol class="story-steps">
            <li>
              <span>01</span>
              <span data-zh="预测颗粒行为">Predict particle behavior</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>02</span>
              <span data-zh="设计可检验的实验">
                Design testable experiments
              </span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>03</span>
              <span data-zh="从结果中学习">Learn from results</span>
            </li>
          </ol>
          <p data-zh="这是我们正在探索的长期愿景，产品能力将通过研究、验证和合作逐步发展。">
            This is a long-term vision we are working toward. Product
            capabilities will develop through research, validation, and
            collaboration.
          </p>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <section class="founders-section" aria-labelledby="founders-title">
        <div class="founders-heading">
          <span class="eyebrow" data-zh="创始团队">
            THE FOUNDING TEAM
          </span>
          <h2 id="founders-title" data-zh="认识我们的团队">
            Meet the team
          </h2>
          <p data-zh="认识正在把这些不同领域连接起来、共同开发 Particle Intelligence 的创始团队。">
            Meet the founders bringing these disciplines together to build
            Particle Intelligence.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="founder-grid">
          <article class="founder-card">
            <span class="founder-role" data-zh="首席执行官 · 联合创始人">
              CEO · CO-FOUNDER
            </span>
            <h3>Daniel Zhong</h3>
            <p data-zh="Daniel Zhong 是 Particle Intelligence 的首席执行官和联合创始人，毕业于宾夕法尼亚大学，是一名图形软件工程师，专长实时渲染与 GPU 编程。他将图形计算与 GPU 编程经验带入公司的软件开发工作。">
              Daniel Zhong is CEO and Co-Founder of Particle Intelligence. A
              University of Pennsylvania graduate, he is a graphics software
              engineer specializing in real-time rendering and GPU programming.
              He brings this graphics and GPU expertise to the company’s
              software development.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="founder-card">
            <span class="founder-role" data-zh="首席技术官 · 联合创始人">
              CTO · CO-FOUNDER
            </span>
            <h3>Langqi Xing</h3>
            <p data-zh="Langqi Xing 是 Northeastern University 机械工程博士研究人员，拥有 UC Santa Barbara 化学工程背景。五年多的研究经历中，他专长于软物质物理、微流控、颗粒输运和计算建模，并发表了多篇同行评审论文。作为 CTO 和联合创始人，他推动输运物理、实验科学与人工智能的融合，以预测、控制和优化颗粒系统。">
              Langqi Xing is a Ph.D. researcher in Mechanical Engineering at
              Northeastern University with a background in Chemical Engineering
              from UC Santa Barbara. With over five years of research
              experience, he specializes in soft matter physics, microfluidics,
              particle transport, and computational modeling. His work has
              resulted in multiple peer-reviewed publications. As CTO and
              Co-Founder, he drives the integration of transport physics,
              experimental science, and artificial intelligence to predict,
              control, and optimize particle-based systems.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="founder-card">
            <span class="founder-role" data-zh="首席财务官 · 联合创始人">
              CFO · CO-FOUNDER
            </span>
            <h3>Chunyang Li</h3>
            <p data-zh="作为 Particle Intelligence 首席财务官，Chunyang Li 负责财务规划和资本配置，支持颗粒运动模型 Phora 推向市场，并与技术团队制定开发预算、预测资金需求和规划产品研发阶段。在 HSBC Securities Services 任职期间，他管理过每年 300 万美元的技术预算，并建立五年期现金流折现模型，比较平台全面替换与定向升级方案。他评估了实施延迟、供应商定价和采用速度对净现值与回收期的影响，建议优先实施回收期较短且在较慢采用情景下仍保持正净现值的升级方案。他还曾在 UNIQLO China 从事商业分析，拥有 Brandeis International Business School 商业分析硕士学位及 Yonsei University 国际商务学士学位。">
              As Chief Financial Officer, Chunyang Li leads financial planning
              and capital allocation as Particle Intelligence brings Phora, its
              particle motion model, to market. He works with the technical team
              on development budgets, cash forecasts, and product investment
              decisions. At HSBC Securities Services, he managed a US$3 million
              annual technology budget and built a five-year discounted cash
              flow model comparing a platform replacement with a targeted
              upgrade. He assessed how implementation delays, vendor pricing,
              and slower adoption affected net present value and payback, and
              recommended the shorter-payback upgrade that retained positive NPV
              under slower adoption. His background also includes commercial
              analytics at UNIQLO China, an M.S. in Business Analytics from
              Brandeis International Business School, and a B.A. in
              International Commerce from Yonsei University.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="founder-card">
            <span
              class="founder-role"
              data-zh="首席人工智能科学家 · 联合创始人"
            >
              CHIEF AI SCIENTIST · CO-FOUNDER
            </span>
            <h3>Ruize Hou</h3>
            <p data-zh="Ruize Hou 负责 Particle Intelligence 的人工智能研究与开发，专注机器学习、深度学习及科学人工智能应用，研究涵盖预测建模、时间序列分析和复杂工程系统的数据驱动方法。他目前在 Northeastern University 攻读工业工程博士，拥有 Cornell University 硕士学位，曾在 Emory University 学习应用数学与统计，并在 Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute 学习数学。">
              Ruize Hou leads AI research and development at Particle
              Intelligence, focusing on machine learning, deep learning, and
              scientific AI applications. His research spans predictive
              modeling, time series analysis, and data-driven approaches to
              complex engineering systems. He is pursuing a Ph.D. in Industrial
              Engineering at Northeastern University and holds a master’s degree
              from Cornell University. He studied Applied Mathematics and
              Statistics at Emory University and Mathematics at Rensselaer
              Polytechnic Institute (RPI).
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="founder-card">
            <span class="founder-role" data-zh="首席研发官 · 联合创始人">
              CHIEF R&D OFFICER · CO-FOUNDER
            </span>
            <h3>Yeqing Ni</h3>
            <p data-zh="Yeqing Ni 是 Northeastern University 机械工程博士候选人，拥有 Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute 机械工程学士学位和 Columbia University 机械工程硕士学位。他的生物力学研究结合有限元分析、计算建模和科学编程，使用基于 MRI 的人体头部模型及 Ansys LS-DYNA 研究固有振型、受迫振动响应和头部损伤力学。他还使用 COMSOL Multiphysics 建立脑肿瘤药物递送模型，并通过血脑屏障细胞系和弥漫性内生型脑桥胶质瘤相关的体外实验进行验证；此外，他使用 MATLAB、Python 和 Fortran 建立冠脉血流 0D–3D 模型。其工程经验还包括数值求解器开发、耐久性测试、数据分析，以及 Abaqus、SolidWorks 和 SimVascular。">
              Yeqing Ni is a Ph.D. candidate in Mechanical Engineering at
              Northeastern University. He earned a bachelor’s degree in
              Mechanical Engineering from Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute and a
              master’s degree in the same field from Columbia University. His
              biomechanics research combines finite element analysis,
              computational modeling, and scientific programming. Using
              MRI-based human head models in Ansys LS-DYNA, he studies natural
              vibration modes, forced vibration response, and head injury
              mechanics. He has also modeled drug delivery to brain tumors in
              COMSOL Multiphysics and conducted in vitro validation with
              blood–brain barrier cell lines and diffuse intrinsic pontine
              glioma. In addition, he has built 0D–3D coronary blood flow models
              using MATLAB, Python, and Fortran. His broader engineering
              experience includes numerical solver development, durability
              testing, data analysis, Abaqus, SolidWorks, and SimVascular.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="contact-cta">
        <div>
          <h2 data-zh="了解研究背景或合作方式？">
            Want to learn more or explore working together?
          </h2>
          <p data-zh="欢迎与我们讨论你的研究或工程需求。">
            We welcome a conversation about your research or engineering needs.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a class="button button-primary" href={withBase("/contact/")}>
          <span data-zh="联系我们">Contact us</span>
          <Icon name="arrow" size={18} />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .about-intro {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 38px;
  }
  .about-intro h1 {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 12px 0 18px;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 64px);
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 1.08;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .about-intro .page-lead {
    max-width: 740px;
  }
  .story-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(280px, 0.75fr);
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .story-copy,
  .story-vision {
    padding: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 38px);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--surface, #fff);
  }
  .story-copy p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .story-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .story-kicker {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  }
  .story-vision h2 {
    margin: 14px 0 20px;
    font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 34px);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .story-steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 11px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .story-steps li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: baseline;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .story-steps li > span:first-child {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .story-vision > p {
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .founders-section {
    margin-top: 76px;
  }
  .founders-heading {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .founders-heading h2 {
    margin: 12px 0;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .founders-heading p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .founder-card {
    padding: 27px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--surface, #fff);
  }
  .founder-card:last-child {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }
  .founder-card:last-child p {
    max-width: 980px;
  }
  .founder-role {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .founder-card h3 {
    margin: 15px 0 12px;
    font-size: 21px;
  }
  .founder-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .story-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .founders-section {
      margin-top: 64px;
    }
    .founder-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .founder-card:last-child {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
